{
  "name": "webtense",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "Europe/Madrid"
  },
  "meta": {
    "template": true,
    "description": "Workflow versionado para ejecutar la automatizacion diaria de Webtense Energy sin secretos hardcodeados en el nodo HTTP y cubriendo ofertas, blog, newsletter y pipeline.",
    "credentialRequirement": {
      "name": "webtense-cron-secret",
      "type": "httpHeaderAuth",
      "headerName": "Authorization",
      "headerValue": "Bearer <CRON_SECRET>"
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-trigger-webtense",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger-webtense",
      "name": "Daily 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        240,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "path": "webtense-test",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger-webtense",
      "name": "Test Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        500
      ],
      "webhookId": "webtense-test"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://webtenseenergy.com/api/automation/daily",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"dryRun\": false,\n  \"forceNewsletter\": false\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-webtense-daily-automation",
      "name": "Run Webtense Daily Automation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        620,
        340
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "__SET_IN_N8N__",
          "name": "webtense-cron-secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# webtense\n\nEjecuta `POST /api/automation/daily` cada dia a las 08:00 Europe/Madrid.\n\nCobertura actual:\n- refresco y envio de ofertas a Telegram\n- envio de posts publicados del blog a Telegram\n- newsletter automatica\n- resumen de leads y estudios\n\nAntes de activar:\n1. Crear credencial `httpHeaderAuth` llamada `webtense-cron-secret`.\n2. Configurar `Authorization: Bearer <CRON_SECRET>`.\n3. Asignar esa credencial al nodo HTTP Request.\n\nPruebas:\n- Manual Trigger para ejecucion ad hoc.\n- Webhook `webtense-test` para smoke test remoto.\n- El backend acepta `dryRun` y `forceNewsletter`."
      },
      "id": "sticky-note-webtense",
      "name": "Notas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run Webtense Daily Automation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Daily 08:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run Webtense Daily Automation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Test Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run Webtense Daily Automation",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
